        <briefdescription>
<para>canEvictInterferenceBasedOnCost - Return true if all interferences between VirtReg and PhysReg can be evicted. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>VirtReg</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Live range that is about to be assigned. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>PhysReg</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Desired register for assignment. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>IsHint</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>True when PhysReg is VirtReg&apos;s preferred register. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>MaxCost</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Only look for cheaper candidates and update with new cost when returning true. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>True when interference can be evicted cheaper than MaxCost. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
