        <definition>bool DefaultEvictionAdvisor::shouldEvict</definition>
        <argsstring>(const LiveInterval &amp;A, bool, const LiveInterval &amp;B, bool) const</argsstring>
        <name>shouldEvict</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::DefaultEvictionAdvisor::shouldEvict</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="_a_arch64_promote_constant_8cpp_1a90f8350fecae261c25be85d38b451bff" kindref="member">const</ref> <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_interval" kindref="compound">LiveInterval</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>A</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classbool" kindref="compound">bool</ref></type>
          <defname>IsHint</defname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="_a_arch64_promote_constant_8cpp_1a90f8350fecae261c25be85d38b451bff" kindref="member">const</ref> <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_interval" kindref="compound">LiveInterval</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>B</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classbool" kindref="compound">bool</ref></type>
          <defname>BreaksHint</defname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>shouldEvict - determine if A should evict the assigned live range B. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The eviction policy defined by this function together with the allocation order defined by enqueue() decides which registers ultimately end up being split and spilled.</para>
<para>Cascade numbers are used to prevent infinite loops if this function is a cyclic relation.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>A</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The live range to be assigned. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>IsHint</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>True when A is about to be assigned to its preferred register. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>B</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The live range to be evicted. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BreaksHint</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>True when B is already assigned to its preferred register. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
